msgstr ""
"The git-stage-Toplu işlem üst veri directory is missing.\n"
"Expected directory: {dir}\n"
"This may indicate the Toplu işlem session was not initialized properly."

#: src/git_stage_batch/batch/state/validation.py:42
#, python-brace-format
